    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  ......呼。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "......呼。"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  各位，看来我们要在这里驻扎一阵子了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "各位，看来我们要在这里驻扎一阵子了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  怎么了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  先遣队观察到了天灾云，没有天灾信使在这附近，以防万一，我们只能尽可能远离天灾。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "先遣队观察到了天灾云，没有天灾信使在这附近，以防万一，我们只能尽可能远离天灾。"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  无论如何，不能冒这个风险。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "无论如何，不能冒这个风险。"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  ......天灾吗。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "......天灾吗。"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  很少亲眼见识到在荒野肆虐的天灾。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "很少亲眼见识到在荒野肆虐的天灾。"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  不过卡兹戴尔和源石打交道的历史也有很久了，倒是不至于那么慌乱。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "不过卡兹戴尔和源石打交道的历史也有很久了，倒是不至于那么慌乱。"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  ......W呢？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "......W呢？"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  待在她自己的小队。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "待在她自己的小队。"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  ......你要去找她？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "......你要去找她？"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  我......不确定。W变了很多。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "我......不确定。W变了很多。"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  你以为W会因为失去特蕾西娅而性情大变。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "你以为W会因为失去特蕾西娅而性情大变。"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  但她现在冷静得不像是W。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "但她现在冷静得不像是W。"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  不过先前在战场上找到她的时候，她确实还是那副玩世不恭的嘴脸。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "不过先前在战场上找到她的时候，她确实还是那副玩世不恭的嘴脸。"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  应该说比起过去有过之而无不及。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "应该说比起过去有过之而无不及。"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  真难得，你竟然能察觉到这种细微的违和感。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "真难得，你竟然能察觉到这种细微的违和感。"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  ......别讽刺我。如果W安静下来，那根本不算“细微”的违和感。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "......别讽刺我。如果W安静下来，那根本不算“细微”的违和感。"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"伊内丝\"]  W她——啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "伊内丝",
        "content": "W她——啊。"
    },
